# Note: Yarn classic (`yarn pack` / `yarn publish`) does not honor this file
# or package.json "files". Releases use npm pack/publish (see release scripts).
# Presence of .npmignore also means npm ignores .gitignore during pack, so
# keep exclusions here in sync with anything that must not ship.

